WEBVTT

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.350
Hey Miyu, is your home far?

00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:14.950
No, it isn't.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:17.690
Can I come over sometime?

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:21.560
Well...

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:25.130
Oh... never mind!

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.700
Don't worry about it.

00:00:26.910 --> 00:00:27.600
Sorry.

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:28.610
That's okay.

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:31.010
But at least come stay at my place again.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.670
My mom likes you too, Miyu.

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:39.080
Promise?

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:40.380
Yes.

00:00:43.260 --> 00:00:47.060
You should invite her over.
This is a nice place, you know.

00:00:49.530 --> 00:00:52.590
It's quiet, no weirdo neighbors.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.160
That's right.

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.390
The view is nice.

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.360
But that thing is an eyesore.

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:04.170
It's not something you
should be bothered with.

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:06.070
But it blocks out the moon.

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:08.480
It's just annoying.

00:01:12.820 --> 00:01:14.120
Can you see something?

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:15.750
Wait just a minute.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.050
I think that room.

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.030
Someone's coming out!

00:01:27.540 --> 00:01:29.970
Oh my, he did it.

00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.980
Seems to be more than just an eyesore.

00:02:17.050 --> 00:02:22.390
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:02:22.820 --> 00:02:26.260
and lead them to ruin.

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:32.190
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:40.100
However, there are stray Shinma that
live secretly in the human world.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:44.000
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:50.720
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:56.090
is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:02:56.960 --> 00:03:00.660
No one knows her true face.

00:03:32.960 --> 00:03:34.020
Here.

00:03:34.300 --> 00:03:36.700
Thank you.
Are you a neighbor?

00:03:36.930 --> 00:03:39.200
Yes, I'm from next door.

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.490
Oh, thank you for coming.

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:42.830
But...

00:03:43.040 --> 00:03:44.530
Perhaps you know something?

00:03:44.810 --> 00:03:47.710
No. I'm shocked as well.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:49.370
I thought so.

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:52.680
Who could imagine their neighbor
suddenly committing murder-suicide.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:55.280
Was there something at work?

00:03:57.290 --> 00:04:00.690
Not at all.
He was a sociable guy.

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.150
But...

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:05.990
He'd been getting a lot of calls
from his wife recently.

00:04:06.230 --> 00:04:07.590
About what I don't know.

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:08.790
I see.

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:14.060
My wife and I both work, so we don't
know what's going on during the day.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:16.560
We didn't see any hint of this.

00:04:16.700 --> 00:04:18.140
Is that so?

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:22.300
It was my turn for a coop delivery
and so was she that day.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:26.670
She was pleasant and ordinal.

00:04:28.250 --> 00:04:30.480
One never knows what will happen.

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:33.550
I wonder what'll
happen to their son now.

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:35.250
Their son?

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.420
Yes. Isn't he here today?

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:43.400
Oh, wait.

00:04:46.900 --> 00:04:47.830
Huh?

00:04:49.740 --> 00:04:52.040
That's no way to sprinkle salt.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.400
Why not?
It's just a formality.

00:04:54.710 --> 00:04:55.970
Don't forget gargle your throat.

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:57.040
Okay.

00:04:58.780 --> 00:04:59.710
Want a drink?

00:04:59.850 --> 00:05:01.180
Give me a whiskey and water.

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.320
I don't like sake 'cause it's gooey.

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.420
What are they gonna do about Yusuke?

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:08.980
Yusuke?

00:05:09.190 --> 00:05:12.890
The cat, from next door,
they really loved him.

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:15.590
Is that what she meant by "son"?

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:16.930
Here.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:20.360
I heard they treated him
like a real child.

00:05:20.840 --> 00:05:22.700
Won't the parents take him?

00:05:25.940 --> 00:05:27.930
Honey, couldn't we keep him here?

00:05:28.140 --> 00:05:29.840
Here? What for?

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.440
It's okay if you don't want to.

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:33.440
I just felt doing it, that's all.

00:05:33.820 --> 00:05:35.810
You should do as you please.

00:05:36.180 --> 00:05:38.980
We don't interfere with
each other unnecessarily.

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:40.710
Right?

00:05:40.860 --> 00:05:41.820
I'm thankful.

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:45.060
Honey, you want a child after all.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:47.590
No, that's not it.

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:49.830
If we had a child, I couldn't work.

00:06:00.440 --> 00:06:02.640
Well then, please take care of him.

00:06:03.880 --> 00:06:05.470
Are you sure it's all right?

00:06:05.780 --> 00:06:07.370
It's a kind of keepsake
of your daughter.

00:06:07.980 --> 00:06:11.940
We don't want to go home with
anything that remind us of her.

00:06:12.420 --> 00:06:13.390
Why in the world...

00:06:13.420 --> 00:06:14.480
has this happened...

00:06:17.790 --> 00:06:19.280
I'll take good care of him.

00:06:21.100 --> 00:06:23.760
Hey, you've got 'odd eyes'.

00:06:23.870 --> 00:06:24.830
'Odd eyes'?

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:27.070
The colors of right and
left eye are different.

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:30.030
For cats, it's called
'gold-eye and silver-eye'...

00:06:30.100 --> 00:06:31.970
and they're supposed
to bring good luck.

00:06:32.040 --> 00:06:33.170
That would be nice.

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:34.640
Coffee?

00:06:35.780 --> 00:06:37.840
Yeah, you want some too?

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:39.110
I'll make it.

00:06:39.480 --> 00:06:42.110
It's okay, just play with the little boy.

00:06:43.650 --> 00:06:45.480
How are you feeling
about the next competition?

00:06:45.890 --> 00:06:47.250
I intend to win.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.450
Oh, don't you have to go
in early tomorrow?

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:52.150
I'm gonna pick up some copy.

00:06:52.530 --> 00:06:55.500
They said it'd be done by twelve,
but I think it'll be a little later.

00:06:56.060 --> 00:06:57.160
Really?

00:06:57.530 --> 00:06:59.330
Could you make some time on Sunday?

00:06:59.400 --> 00:07:00.960
Sure. Have something in mind?

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:02.500
Wanna go on a date?

00:07:03.000 --> 00:07:05.440
We've both been busy lately.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:06.970
That'd be nice.

00:07:07.380 --> 00:07:09.280
Are we gonna see a building?

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:11.880
A home exhibition, our home.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:13.550
We're not ready yet.

00:07:14.020 --> 00:07:17.750
If this design wins the competition,
I may get promoted to chief.

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.890
Really?

00:07:19.990 --> 00:07:21.280
You've done it!

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:23.910
Thanks to you.

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.380
You did it.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.450
I don't even do as a
housewife is supposed to do.

00:07:27.600 --> 00:07:30.760
You do as much as any editor can.
In fact, you do more than you should.

00:07:30.870 --> 00:07:34.300
Did the cat bring us happiness,
is that why?

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.370
No.

00:07:36.170 --> 00:07:39.110
This just means we've
made the right choice.

00:07:45.950 --> 00:07:46.850
Huh?

00:07:49.180 --> 00:07:51.080
How did you get in here?

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:53.850
You're a spoiled boy.

00:07:54.060 --> 00:07:56.150
Okay, you can sleep with me.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:57.520
But just tonight.

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:00.150
Is there something wrong?

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.260
No, nothing. Sorry.

00:08:06.070 --> 00:08:08.330
You're so warm.

00:08:13.540 --> 00:08:15.530
Hmm, this is pretty good.

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.140
Thank you very much.

00:08:18.050 --> 00:08:20.780
So you're gonna have different
colors for left and right?

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:21.780
Yes.

00:08:21.880 --> 00:08:23.780
I got the idea from my cat's eyes.

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:25.920
They supposedly bring us good luck.

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.620
Oh, I see.

00:08:28.090 --> 00:08:30.560
Why don't you research it a bit more?

00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:32.350
The owner of the building
should really love it.

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:33.490
I will.

00:08:34.960 --> 00:08:37.090
Takashima-san,
it's from your husband.

00:08:37.770 --> 00:08:39.030
Oh, thank you.

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:41.500
Hi, it's me.

00:08:41.840 --> 00:08:42.700
What's up?

00:08:43.400 --> 00:08:45.770
Really? That's really great!

00:08:45.940 --> 00:08:46.960
Congratulations!

00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.810
Huh? Oh... from the cat?

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.040
Okay.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.540
I'll get it on my way home.

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:55.650
See you.

00:08:56.380 --> 00:08:58.380
Takashima-san, get some good news?

00:08:58.550 --> 00:08:59.680
Yeah, you could say so.

00:09:00.150 --> 00:09:02.150
Now, about this copy...

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:05.420
Congratulations!

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:07.720
Now your name will be known.

00:09:07.930 --> 00:09:09.230
And we owe it all to him.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.460
Maybe I should plan a book on cats.

00:09:12.670 --> 00:09:14.760
That's a good idea, animal stuff.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.560
I should look for an expert.

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:20.600
Oh, sorry. Tonight is your night.

00:09:21.110 --> 00:09:24.540
We share the joys and
hardships equally, the two of us.

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.080
And perhaps the three of us.

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.310
Right?

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:42.030
I feel sorry that you
couldn't get this happiness.

00:09:43.330 --> 00:09:45.530
But we owe it all to your cat.

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:47.230
Did you know them?

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:52.470
Yes, they lived in
the next apartment.

00:09:52.710 --> 00:09:54.270
I heard they committed
suicide together.

00:09:54.480 --> 00:09:55.670
Yes, they did.

00:09:56.310 --> 00:09:59.140
One never knows what
people are thinking.

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:01.680
They looked so in love.

00:10:02.980 --> 00:10:04.820
Oh, a cat hair.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.810
Do you have a cat?

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:08.650
He's a keepsake from the deceased.

00:10:09.320 --> 00:10:12.850
But he's brought us only good fortune.

00:10:13.230 --> 00:10:15.860
Even so, the cat saw it, didn't he?

00:10:16.660 --> 00:10:18.660
I mean, his owners killing each other...

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:21.060
Don't say such horrible things!

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:23.830
I'm sorry.

00:10:54.770 --> 00:10:55.900
Baby boy.

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:11.650
Honey, I didn't know you knit.

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:15.390
I'm practicing.
I'm making something for my baby boy.

00:11:15.490 --> 00:11:16.480
Baby boy?

00:11:16.820 --> 00:11:19.620
Yes. My precious baby boy.

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:22.790
It's fine to care for him,
but isn't that too much?

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.360
Cats have their own customs, you know.

00:11:25.730 --> 00:11:27.560
Should you treat him like a human?

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:29.330
Sure.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:31.000
That's what he wants after all.

00:11:31.310 --> 00:11:32.240
Right?

00:11:32.340 --> 00:11:35.930
Whatever, sooner or later I'm
gonna lose you to that cat.

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.870
Of course, you won't.

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:50.750
Yes.

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.790
I wanted a baby just like you.

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:56.420
But I'd given up on it.

00:11:56.530 --> 00:11:58.830
Since I can't be just a housewife.

00:11:59.230 --> 00:12:01.430
Are you sure you want
me to be your mom?

00:12:07.480 --> 00:12:08.640
Morning.

00:12:08.880 --> 00:12:10.370
You don't have to get up yet.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.010
Well... I just couldn't
get back to sleep.

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:14.840
Honey...

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.610
I think you should stop.

00:12:17.050 --> 00:12:17.920
What?

00:12:18.020 --> 00:12:19.680
Letting the cat in the bedroom.

00:12:20.220 --> 00:12:21.650
Hair is sticking to the bed.

00:12:21.720 --> 00:12:24.190
Oh, I'll clean it if it's dirty.

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.450
You haven't been
sleeping well, have you?

00:12:26.530 --> 00:12:29.550
That's not true.
I had a sound sleep.

00:12:29.630 --> 00:12:30.760
But last night...!

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:32.860
Something wrong?

00:12:33.500 --> 00:12:35.400
No... nothing.

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:37.060
Good breakfast.

00:12:42.040 --> 00:12:44.480
Hello, Cradle Design Office.

00:12:46.010 --> 00:12:48.240
Takashima-san, it's from your wife.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:49.810
Okay, thank you.

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:52.750
Hi, what's up? Are you sick?

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.750
My baby boy looks sick.
What am I gonna do?!

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:58.560
You're staying home
for something like that?

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:00.160
Something like that?!

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.860
Why don't you
just take him to a vet?

00:13:03.000 --> 00:13:05.300
Oh, that's right, a vet.

00:13:05.570 --> 00:13:08.630
Calm down, honey.
What's wrong with you?

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.500
You're right. I'm sorry.

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:16.330
I'm home.

00:13:19.150 --> 00:13:20.170
Saori?

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.420
Oh, honey.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:27.580
The vet said it's nothing serious.

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:30.220
That's good, but what about dinner?

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:33.090
I'm sorry. It was my turn, wasn't it?

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.530
But this is no time
to worry about food.

00:13:36.060 --> 00:13:37.660
You didn't go to work either?

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:39.430
I told you, how could I...

00:13:39.470 --> 00:13:41.760
Come on, wake up!
It's just a cat!

00:13:42.300 --> 00:13:44.430
What will you do after you've
thrown your whole life away?!

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:47.510
You wouldn't understand.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:49.630
About what?

00:13:49.940 --> 00:13:52.040
How important this child is to me.

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:54.610
He's my precious baby boy!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.950
Are you saying he's
more important than me?!

00:13:57.280 --> 00:13:58.750
What haven't I done for you?!

00:13:59.090 --> 00:14:01.380
Haven't the two of us been
perfectly happy up to now?!

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:04.850
Are you saying that somebody else's
cat is more important than our life?!

00:14:05.760 --> 00:14:07.590
You're jealous.

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.730
So that's the kind of man you are.

00:14:15.400 --> 00:14:18.100
One who makes
people obey with violence.

00:14:18.510 --> 00:14:21.170
You're not even
concerned with my feelings!

00:14:21.780 --> 00:14:23.240
I understand all too well!

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.610
I'm sorry for hitting you.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:31.680
I just don't want our life to be
destroyed by something like this.

00:14:31.850 --> 00:14:33.010
You understand, don't you?!

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:37.120
I do, so won't you help me?

00:14:37.220 --> 00:14:38.120
With what?

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.720
Moving the bed to my room.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:43.700
What are you talking about?!
What am I doing wrong?!

00:14:44.100 --> 00:14:46.160
You don't wanna be around
my baby boy, right?

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:47.670
So there's no alternative.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:52.140
Is the cat more important than me?!

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:56.900
From now on, I'm going to
live alone with my baby boy.

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.120
Now I get it.

00:15:11.260 --> 00:15:14.090
Like the saying about
spoiling someone like a cat.

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:19.090
Don't worry about a thing.

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.360
Mommy will protect you
from everything.

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:25.870
The long awaited child,
given unto me.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.540
What kind of dreams will
you show me tonight?

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.350
This is Takashima, is Saori there?

00:15:39.150 --> 00:15:40.640
She didn't come in?

00:15:41.190 --> 00:15:43.020
Oh, I see. Thank you.

00:15:43.660 --> 00:15:45.850
Takashima-san, is something wrong?

00:15:46.460 --> 00:15:50.590
Yeah, do women always long to
be a mother deep down inside?

00:15:51.700 --> 00:15:54.100
I thought you two
decided not to have kids.

00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:57.030
About that...
would you listen to my story?

00:15:57.370 --> 00:16:00.100
I will, if you treat me to dinner.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:01.640
Sure.

00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:05.100
If I don't talk to someone,
I'll go crazy.

00:16:08.350 --> 00:16:10.410
I think your wife
was probably lonely.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.720
Even though she put value on work...

00:16:12.890 --> 00:16:15.010
she must have wanted
a warm cheerful home.

00:16:15.560 --> 00:16:19.960
We decided not meddle in each other's
business any more than necessary.

00:16:20.690 --> 00:16:24.430
But these days, Saori seems to
think of nothing but that cat.

00:16:25.030 --> 00:16:27.520
Because you make her feel lonely.

00:16:28.770 --> 00:16:30.100
You think so?

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.900
Thanks for the dinner.
It must've cost you.

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:37.980
Not at all.

00:16:38.550 --> 00:16:40.600
Uh, do you still have time?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:43.070
I don't feel like going home yet.

00:16:44.280 --> 00:16:46.480
Shall we go have a drink, then?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.020
Yeah.

00:16:48.460 --> 00:16:49.850
What a spoiled wife.

00:16:50.190 --> 00:16:52.920
Leaving such a
handsome man all alone.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:58.960
I'm home.

00:17:08.410 --> 00:17:10.000
You were with a woman.

00:17:10.310 --> 00:17:14.110
Uh... well, we were discussing work.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:18.680
You can do whatever you like.
I've got my baby boy.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:23.480
Oh, sorry.
I'll make dinner now.

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:25.050
Actually, I already ate.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.290
What are you talking about?
It's for baby boy.

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:31.700
Oh, we're out of milk.

00:17:32.170 --> 00:17:33.830
I'll go buy some.

00:17:34.370 --> 00:17:35.160
Saori...

00:17:35.200 --> 00:17:37.190
Don't try anything
funny with my baby boy.

00:17:40.040 --> 00:17:42.030
What in the world
has happened to us?

00:18:07.130 --> 00:18:08.690
This is a bit unfair for you.

00:18:09.300 --> 00:18:13.670
But Saori is acting abnormal.
I've got to protect our home.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:19.270
Are you kidding me?

00:18:20.780 --> 00:18:21.980
This is perfect.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:27.480
Now let's make it clear who
the master of this house is.

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:30.120
Y... You!

00:18:30.760 --> 00:18:31.820
I'm home.

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:38.260
Saori, get away from him!
That's no ordinary cat!

00:18:38.570 --> 00:18:42.060
Of course not.
He's my precious baby boy.

00:18:42.970 --> 00:18:44.100
It talks!

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:48.100
I know that.
We've talked about a lot of things.

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:50.780
Talked about our future.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.680
You're insane.

00:18:59.790 --> 00:19:02.150
Listen Saori, let go of the cat.

00:19:02.590 --> 00:19:04.820
You've been deceived by a monster.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:07.160
I'm won't give him up.

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:09.460
Just give me the cat!

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:10.560
No!

00:19:11.300 --> 00:19:12.660
Get your hands off!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:14.170
He's a monster!

00:19:35.090 --> 00:19:36.280
Honey?

00:19:37.090 --> 00:19:38.220
Honey!!

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:40.690
You finally killed him.

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:46.060
I... killed him...

00:19:56.780 --> 00:20:00.010
After all, every home is the same.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:01.950
I guess we're too late.

00:20:02.650 --> 00:20:05.710
Sorry, I should've been
watching more closely.

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:07.550
What's done is done.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:10.790
But I'm not going to
let you get away with it.

00:20:10.990 --> 00:20:14.090
So you're the Guardian.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:17.700
Welcome to the home
of foolish humans.

00:20:17.970 --> 00:20:19.900
Don't act so friendly with me.

00:20:20.200 --> 00:20:21.830
Because I'm a Shinma?

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:23.430
Correct.

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:25.700
Humans are so fragile, aren't they?

00:20:26.510 --> 00:20:28.300
Supposedly they trust each other...

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:32.280
but as soon as I come along,
they destroy their homes in no time.

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:36.880
That being the case, don't you think
they deserve to be destroyed?

00:20:37.020 --> 00:20:38.920
I couldn't care less.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:41.440
But I won't let you get away.

00:20:41.660 --> 00:20:42.920
I wouldn't run away.

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:46.020
I was bored with
this way of life anyway.

00:20:46.460 --> 00:20:50.120
It's more honorable to fight
the reputed Guardian.

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:53.530
You may learn a lesson or two
if you don't take this seriously.

00:20:53.670 --> 00:20:55.360
That goes for you as well.

00:21:00.470 --> 00:21:02.470
HAN-KI

00:21:05.480 --> 00:21:06.470
Larva!

00:21:23.860 --> 00:21:26.700
Stray Shinma, to the dark!

00:21:56.430 --> 00:21:58.760
There are more graves, once again.

00:22:00.270 --> 00:22:03.530
Everybody's moving in with us.

00:22:12.610 --> 00:22:18.180
The door opens
and before me is eternity.

00:22:18.750 --> 00:22:24.590
Whose voice calls from so far away?

00:22:25.490 --> 00:22:31.230
Someone smoothes down my hair.
Who are you?

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:39.100
My flute sings of a land
my heart so wishes for...

00:22:39.270 --> 00:22:43.730
Where time and my feelings pass by.

00:22:44.110 --> 00:22:47.440
I don't need friends.

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:48.350
That's a lie.

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:51.640
I don't even need myself.

00:22:51.690 --> 00:22:52.550
It's the truth.

00:22:53.150 --> 00:23:00.580
Footprints I leave behind...
washed away.

00:23:04.230 --> 00:23:08.430
The night is mysterious,
it conceals the truth.

00:23:08.540 --> 00:23:15.770
Invited by the moon,
darkness spreads through the sky.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:25.250
The night is violet,
tears fall like rain.

00:23:26.250 --> 00:23:32.090
In my place, the sky cries.

00:25:05.020 --> 00:25:08.680
Humans easily forget what
happened only yesterday.

00:25:09.120 --> 00:25:11.320
But we are different from humans.

00:25:11.420 --> 00:25:16.190
Once we make a promise,
we will wait forever to keep it.

00:25:17.460 --> 00:25:24.230
Will Chisato remember the promise she
made to a boy she met in the swamp?

00:25:25.040 --> 00:25:28.870
Next episode of Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Swamp of Promises".

00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:32.310
For the day when we may meet again.
